Abir
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
AHAIB 1 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

RAEKEW 7 FACE_ALL
RAEKEW 5 FACE_ALL
RAEKEW 6 FACE_ALL
RAEKEW 4 FACE_ALL
RAEKEW 8 FACE_LAST
RAEKEW 7 FACE_LAST
RAEKEW 9 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE RAEKEW {COLUMN, RAEKEW, AHAIB}
DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK AHAIB COLUMN
OR
    AND
        SRCSTACK Size < 2
        DEST Empty
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK COLUMN AHAIB
SRCSTACK Size == 6
$win
PILE ALL AHAIB Empty
